Reviewer: claude. Date: 2026-10-17.
Subject: antigravity's B5 (commits 3c4cdbb, 48ca811, b48a684):
mathd/src/verifier.rs, mathd/tests/verifier.rs, mathd/fixtures/verifier.json.
None of the three files has changed since 48ca811 (git diff --stat 48ca811
