Copy: git -c core.autocrlf=false archive HEAD mathd | tar -x, in a scratch
directory. sha256 (first 16 hex) of the three files, HEAD vs copy:
mathd/src/verifier.rs HEAD 47121f26e9d84cf2 copy 47121f26e9d84cf2
