mutants skips one -1 mutant, 8 of them Failed and 2 Verified. Equation arms:
+1 118 Failed and 10 Verified; -1 118 Failed and 10 Verified. Not reported
anywhere: 53 excused Verified (43 integral, 10 equation +1), 10 equation -1
Verified that no branch counts, 5 Unverifiable, 840 discarded. A
factorisation mutant that is Verified is not counted as FP either (lines
652-670 count only Failed). Report all of these in the matrix.
Also: a constant claim (no variables) is Verified on 1 point, below the work
order's "at least 8 random points"; and equation parameters are drawn only
from [0.5, 4.0], positive only, which is the same class as V1.

